node_modules/
dist/

# `vercel link` inside ui/ writes a .env.local holding a VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN.
#
# This line is doing two jobs.  The obvious one is git.  The other is the
# dashboard's UPLOAD filter: the CLI deploys ui/ as its own project (D15.6), so
# the root .gitignore is outside the deploy root and does not apply, and there
# is deliberately no ui/.vercelignore -- creating one would REPLACE this file
# as the filter and let node_modules back in (D15.4).  So the credential is
# kept out of the dashboard bundle by this line and only by this line (D17.7).
.env*
!.env.example
